## PR Description

Closes #393
### What changed
Added Jira-style field names (`key`, `status`, `labels`, `parent`, `updated`, `created`, `issuetype`, `assignee`, `reporter`, `project`) to the ADO `_fieldNames` table so agents' Jira-style `fields` no longer fail with `TF51535`.

### Key decisions
- Mirrors Java `AzureDevOpsClient` (dm.ai #707) exactly, all lowercase keys.
